        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "g. If an employee accepts an offer of placement under this Section, any other placement rights to which the employee may be entitled under this Section cease. In addition, such employee shall complete an \"Availability for Temporary Employment\" questionnaire. If an employee indicates a desire not to be offered placement to temporary positions no such offers will",
